<h1>Car Dealerships in Carroll, Iowa</h1>

<p>Carroll, Iowa has several car dealerships within a few miles of each other, and Motor Inn Auto Group at 1526 Le Clark Road is the local Toyota and Chevrolet store, family-owned since 1937. This page helps you compare the Carroll options on the things that change the buying experience: brand coverage, service after the sale, and a straight answer on price and trade.</p>

<h2>What should I compare between Carroll car dealerships?</h2>

<p>Compare four things at any Carroll dealership: whether the store has the vehicle you want listed today, whether it services what it sells on the same lot, whether it will put a trade figure in writing, and whether the full price, including fees, is clear before you drive over. Dealerships that answer those four plainly are the short list.</p>

<p>Brand coverage matters too. Motor Inn lists new Toyotas and new Chevrolets alongside used vehicles across brands, so one visit covers more ground than a single-brand stop.</p>

<h2>Is Motor Inn actually in Carroll?</h2>

<p>Yes. Motor Inn Auto Group is at 1526 Le Clark Road, Carroll, IA 51401. Check <a href="/hours.aspx">hours and directions</a> before you come. Drivers come in from Lake City, Denison, Audubon, Storm Lake and Sac City, so if you are making a drive, call 712-792-5000 first and tell us which vehicles you want to see.</p>

<h2>Can I compare new and used in one visit?</h2>

<p>Ask and we can walk you through both. Shoppers regularly weigh a new Silverado against a used one, or a new Highlander against a used one, and the listing pages make that easy to start at home: browse the <a href="/searchnew.aspx">new inventory</a> and the <a href="/used-inventory">used inventory</a>, or go by type - <a href="/new-toyota">new Toyotas</a>, <a href="/new-chevrolets.html">new Chevrolets</a>, <a href="/used-trucks">used trucks</a>, <a href="/used-suvs">used SUVs</a>.</p>

<h2>Will you appraise my trade-in?</h2>

<p>You can ask for a trade figure for your current vehicle as part of any visit, and our <a href="/trade.aspx">trade-in page</a> explains how that works. For payment ranges, the <a href="/finance-locations.html">finance pages</a> and a call to 712-792-5000 get you numbers to weigh before you decide anything.</p>

<h2>How do I reach the store before I drive over?</h2>

<p>Call Motor Inn Auto Group at 712-792-5000, or <a href="/contactus.aspx">send a question</a> and tell us which vehicles you want to compare. If you already know the one, <a href="/testdrive.aspx">schedule a test drive</a> before you make the drive.</p>
